format gbcli-pixels 1
# Gag glasses, after Ben's reference photo (2026-11-16 art review): bushy
# black eyebrows over round black frames and a big nose; a big, black,
# bushy Groucho mustache; and the disguise, the mustache right under the
# nose. Three 16x16 frames. Pieces are objects too, so no dark gray: clear
# shows the belt behind them (tools/tiles.py). On a GBC the nose's light
# gray is the pieces' palette's middle color.
size 48 16
color . clear
color w #ffffff
color l #aaaaaa
color k #000000
fill .

rows 0 0    # half A: eyebrows, glasses and the big nose
.k.kk.k..k.kk.k.
kkkkkkk..kkkkkkk
................
.kkkkk....kkkkk.
kwwwwwkkkkwwwwwk
kwwwwwkllkwwwwwk
kwwwwwkllkwwwwwk
.kwwwkllllkwwwk.
..kkkllllllkkk..
....kllllllk....
...kllllllllk...
...klwwlllllk...
..kllllllllllk..
..kllkllllkllk..
...kkkkkkkkkk...
................

rows 16 0   # half B: the mustache, big, black and bushy
................
................
................
.....k.kk.k.....
...kkkkkkkkkk...
..kkkkkkkkkkkk..
.kkkkkkkkkkkkkk.
kkkkkklkklkkkkkk
kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk
kkklkkkkkkkklkkk
kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk
kkkkkkk..kkkkkkk
.k.kk.k..k.kk.k.
